# Host build artifacts must never enter the image: the builder compiles
# deps fresh against the alpine/musl toolchain (Dockerfile `mix deps.get`
# + `deps.compile`). Copying a host-compiled `deps/` / `_build/` over them
# clobbers the musl NIFs with glibc ones (sqlite3_nif.so / vec0.so),
# producing a `symbol not found` relocation crash at runtime.
backend/deps/
backend/_build/
backend/erl_crash.dump
backend/dmhai.db
backend/dmhai.db-*
backend/tmp/

# Compiled in the musl builder; never ship a host (glibc) build.
backend/priv/spellfix1.so
